==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|ru|разо-||before certain consonant clusters}}
* {{alt|ru|рас-||before voiceless consonants}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|роз-}}, from {{der|ru|sla-pro|*orz-}}. The spelling "раз-" was reinforced by {{bor|ru|cu|раз-}}, as well as vowel reduction, which is also reflected in {{cog|be|раз-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|раз-}}

===Prefix===
{{head|ru|prefix|cat2=verbal prefixes}}

# {{lb|ru|used with verbs}} [[asunder]], [[apart]]
# {{lb|ru|used with verbs}} [[dis-]], [[di-]], [[un-]]
#: {{prefex|ru|!разо-|-йти́|t2=to [[go]]|-сь|разойти́сь|t4=to go asunder, to disagree}}
#: {{prefex|ru|дева́ть|t1=to put|раздева́ть|t2=to undress}}
# {{lb|ru|used with verbs}} [[enlarged]] action
#: {{prefex|ru|рабо́тать|t1=to work|разрабо́тать|t2=to [[develop]], to [[work out]]}}
# {{lb|ru|used with verbs}} with [[reflexive]]s, giving free [[rein]] to
#: {{prefex|ru|говори́ть|t1=to talk|-ся|разговори́ться|t3=to talk up a storm}}
# {{lb|ru|used with verbs|in the negative}} [[not quite]]
#: {{prefex|ru|не|t1=[[not]]|!рас-|слы́шать|t3=to [[hear]]|[[не]] [[расслы́шать]]|t4=to [[not]] [[quite]] [[hear]]}}

====Usage notes====
When stressed, {{m|ru|раз-}} normally changes into {{m|ru|ро́з-}}, and the voiceless variant {{m|ru|рас-}} correspondingly becomes {{m|ru|ро́с-}}:
* {{m|ru|разда́ть||to distribute}} → past passive participle {{m|ru|ро́зданный}}
* {{m|ru|расписа́ть||to [[paint]], to [[decorate]]}} + {{m|ru|-ь|pos=noun-forming suffix, which normally causes stress to move onto a prefix}} → {{m|ru|ро́спись||[[painting]], [[mural]]}}

